{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>And this.</b> The meaning is: this is the offering. Similarly, זה יתנו (below, verse 30:13) means: this is the amount. Similarly, וזה אשר תעשה אותם (Genesis 6:15 [?]): Moses shall do so for the seven days of ordination, and afterward Aaron and his sons."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {0 "The citation Genesis 6:15 does not match the quoted phrase וזה אשר תעשה אותם; this appears to be an error in the text or an unusual reference resolution. Translating the citation as given."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:12.843397674Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}